# 05_dicom_simple — depth-dose along beam axis
# CT centered at isocenter (origin), beam along +Z from z=-15 cm
# 126 MeV protons stop around z=0 (Bragg peak ~13.2 cm in water from entry)

Geometry Mesh
    Name DepthDose
    X -2.5  2.5    1
    Y -2.5  2.5    1
    Z -13.5 13.5  270


Geometry Mesh
    Name MyXZ
    X -15.0  15.0    300
    Y -0.5    0.5    1
    Z -15.0  15.0    300

Output
    Filename depth_dose.dat
    Fileformat TEXT
    Geo DepthDose
    Quantity Fluence

Output
    Filename depth_dose.bdo
    Geo MyXZ
    Quantity Fluence
